<title>JAPAN: Fuji Electronics -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Electronics -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.15		vs	    7.77</p>
<p> Operating	  406    million	  vs	  404    million</p>
<p> Current	    471    million	  vs	  408    million</p>
<p> Net		   25    million	  vs	  216    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.25 yen	  vs	   20.11 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Electronics Co Ltd sells semiconductors, integrated circuits and electronic equipment.</p>
